  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for php8",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for php8 fixes the following issues\n\n- Update to version 8.4.24\n- CVE-2026-7260: Stack overflow in phar with circular symlinks (bsc#1273077).\n- CVE-2026-9672: Upgrade libgd (bsc#1273078).\n- CVE-2026-17543: SQL injection in ext-pgsql via E'...' backslash breakout (bsc#1273075).\n- CVE-2026-17544: Out-of-bounds write in bccomp() via crafted operand and scale (bsc#1273076).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
